# ===========================================================================
# FolioSparks — environment template
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (same folder, next to vite.config.ts) and fill in
# your values:   cp .env.example .env
#
# This is the ONLY env file in the project. Vite loads it from the project
# root because that's where vite.config.ts is. All variables MUST be prefixed
# with VITE_ to be visible in the app.
# Restart `npm run dev` after changing .env.
# ===========================================================================

